                                                "sense_id": "b3e23158-42cb-3381-9c7a-439c95dde38e",
                                                "text": "A man is beloued of a man, in that he is a man, but all theſe are farre more eminent and great, when they ſhal proceed from a ſanctified ſpirit, that hath a true touch of Religion, and a reference to God."
